repository-code: "https://github.com/linzialessandro/Quotients-of-Finite-Fields-Optimized"
url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.03625"
abstract: >-
  Research library for Krasner quotient hyperfields of finite fields F_q / G_d:
  construction, layered isomorphism (Baker–Jin / general), char and C-char,
  censuses, and paper-driven experiments accompanying arXiv:2608.03625.
  Version 0.2.0 speeds up prime-field arithmetic and large-q scans without
  changing the mathematical algorithms of the companion paper.
